Yark Dole...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.570
That name again?

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:02.660
I hear he's the man who gave Fardain their mobile suit blueprints.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.830
Everyone, may I have your attention. {not polite enough for a please}

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.800
We have three days until we depart Fardain.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.340
And our next destination...

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.840
...is Colony Tordia.

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.340
No.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.260
We're changing the destination.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.430
We'll be going to...

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.770
Colony Minsry.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.850
Why in the world are we going there?!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.690
Captain, please explain!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:32.150
Until now, humanity has endured the brutality of the UE.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.740
But any further violence is unforgivable.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.580
I have thoroughly analyzed the data collected thus far,

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:45.330
and finally concluded that the UE are hiding in the abandoned space fortress Ambat.{these people should be shot}

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.580
We must not miss this chance.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.840
What's he going to do?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:51.630
He can't mean...

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:59.800
This vessel will form a fleet with two Euba ships and two Zalam ships, and attack the UE stronghold!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.220
That's crazy, no matter the circumstance!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:09.060
And to top it off, joining with a private fleet instead of the Federation... Central Command would never permit that.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.940
I couldn't care less about the Federation.{I can though herpderp}

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.900
I am not your captain.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.070
Huh?

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.160
Um...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.620
There's a reason for that.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:27.460
A reason?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.670
What reason?!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.750
Adams!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.250
If you know something, then tell us, Emily.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.170
R-Right.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:39.680
I overheard the previous captain talking.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.060
It's an idiotic plan. {make sure same as ep 2}{i was just about to change that...}

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:48.390
He wants to pull the core out of the colony, and he expects the Diva to control it!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.360
We'll ignore him, of course.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:56.070
The Diva will immediately retreat from the dangerous situation at Nora.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.660
Then if the original captain was still in charge, the people of Nora would've...

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.910
Yes.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.700
I didn't know who was right back then,

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:10.420
But now I know. What Mr. Grodek did was the right thing.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:15.590
If the old captain was still in command, everybody at Nora would've been abandoned to die.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.670
So... So...

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:22.930
Yeah, I could see Dian Fonroid doing that.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:27.680
And without Captain Grodek's judgment, the Diva wouldn't have made it this far.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.270
Mr. Woolf...

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.100
Miss Millais...

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:36.360
But what you've done is a major violation of military law.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.360
That's unacceptable for a soldier.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.910
The Federation Forces are already after me for mutiny.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:46.080
But all of this is to defeat the UE!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.290
The captain...

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:54.170
Mr. Grodek lost his family to a UE attack.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.550
Flit is correct.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:02.090
I despise the UE.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.760
The Day Angel Fell...{Second Impact}{angel fall... Index anyone?}

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.810
That was the beginning of everything.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:15.770
My wife and child were killed by the UE.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:19.570
My daughter Sara was only seven.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.990
I swore revenge on the UE that day.

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.910
Captain... No, Commander...

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.670
Are you going to drag us along on your revenge?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:37.500
Of course I'm not going to force anyone to do that.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:43.130
Come with me, and the Federation Forces will pursue you as mutineers.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:47.550
If anyone wants to leave the Diva, you may leave now.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.390
I will fight the UE even if I have to do it alone.{I will fight them even if it means doing it alone}

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.610
I'll fight with you!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:58.230
Flit!

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:00.110
Flit...

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.740
This battle will be fierce.{looks like a 12ep series?}

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.400
I cannot guarantee you'll survive.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.870
I lost my mom and dad, too!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:14.410
If this keeps going, even more people will lose family and friends to the UE{just like you and me}! {I know it's there, but it's also redundant because "even more" and thats why i didnt add it in}

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.460
He beat me to the punch. {nice}

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:19.590
Mr. Woolf...

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:20.920
I'm coming too.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:26.260
Nobody else in the Federation Forces would be dumb enough to pick a fight with the UE.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.930
I'll go with you.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.310
The Diva won't run without an operator.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.890
Sounds good, Millie!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:38.520
Of course, I'll help beat the UE too!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:39.650
Me too.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.320
Right?

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:43.360
Yes, we're members of the Diva crew now.{wow, this guy is so gay}{He should've said "We'll stay on even though we're side characters"}{he needs a lisp}

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.200
Enemy detection systems have picked something up! {we went with detection system last time? check?}

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.790
Multiple moving objects, which appear to be UE!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:57.670
Uh-oh. They came to us first.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:01.750
Seems like the UE really mean to crush us this time.

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.340
Ready, Flit?

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.010
